text = "Add a new button for specific title search instead of just IDs

Change the rich label text so it has different colors for the different rows; yellow for the title and white/gray for the description. Find out what's better; if to show the title and id and then make the description expandable or make the expandable part just the small details like location and date. 

Lean into the minecraft chatbox aesthetic too, and also make a \"page empty\" if the current_offset is higher than the amount of text that there is, that is simple right?"
